	"data": "Delsys Interview Prep\nMeeting with Gianluca de Luca, President — Fri Apr 17, 12:00pm (45min)\n\n🎓 Senior Design Project — Voice Scheduler\n\nVoice Scheduler — a voice-first meeting room booking system\nSpeech transcription → LLM-assisted natural language request handling → Django REST backend\nUsers speak naturally: \"Book room 3 from 2–3pm\" → parsed, validated, booked\nFull stack: microphone client, Django REST API, SQLite DB, Textual TUI for management, CLI tools\nDeployed server, real booking system,…",
